{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "费用估算(2026-09-24 二版:加 14 天迷你柱 + 近 7 天变化)。大数 = 今天;柱 = 近 14 天每日费用(今天那根源色);底行 = 近 7 天与对比前 7 天。全部按 Anthropic API 标价折算 —— 订阅用户不按这个付钱,副标写「按 API 标价」,绝不写成「花了」。\n柱的 y / h = 布局锚点 + 常量 × 数据变量(同 heatmap.rcn 的写法);v/u 恒有值(服务端给数字)。底槽一条发丝线画在 forEach 外,零数据时也看得出这里是个图。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "费用估算",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "today": "今天 · 按 API 标价",
        "d7": "近 7 天 "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Est. cost",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "today": "Today · API list prices",
        "d7": "7 days "
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点：本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档，与仪表盘上其它信息源区分开。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${costToday}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${costToday}",
            "fontSize": "28pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${costToday}),k),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+8.4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "28pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sub",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+32pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.today}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "id": "base",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-32pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "1pt",
        "bgColor": "#EFE5E1|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${costBars}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12pt+${_it.i}*({parent.w}-24pt)/14",
            "y": "{parent.h}-62pt+30pt*${_it.u}",
            "w": "({parent.w}-24pt)/14-2.4pt",
            "h": "30pt*${_it.v}",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "1.5pt",
              "rightT": "1.5pt",
              "leftB": "0pt",
              "rightB": "0pt"
            },
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.t},1),#C15F3C|#E8916B,#E9D5CD|#3B302B)]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d7",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.d7}$[findNotEmpty::(${cost7},--)]  ${cost7Chg}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚 y = 卡名 y + 3:txt 盒顶 = 墨迹顶,同盒顶时 9pt 锚的基线比 13pt 卡名高 4.5pt(cell_align 实测),+3 后差 ≤ 1pt(卡片设计系统 §3「与组件名同基线」)",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      }
    ]
  }
}